  "category": "other",
  "positioning": "Historic lakeside hotel in Cernobbio on Lake Como, with rooms and suites across the Cardinal's Building and the Queen's Pavilion and four private villas in its centuries-old park",
  "best_for": [
    "Travelers who want a room or suite facing Lake Como",
